			"notes": "## 3.1.4\n\n### New: Import & Export ability trees\nImport ability trees from the WynnBuilder website as Wynntils ability-tree loadouts, and export your loadouts back to a hash.\n\n- **`/build exporttree <loadout>`** - prints an encoded hash of any build or ability-tree loadout, with a one-click copy button. Paste it into the Ability Tree section on the WynnBuilder website.\n- **`/build importtree <tree_code> <class> <loadout_name>`** - imports a hash back into a new wynntils ability-tree loadout.\n### New: Export Wynntils Build Loadouts\n - **`/build loadout <loadout_name>`** - export a loadout with precise or default rolls, depending of your config.\n\n### Misc\n- Wynntils dependency updated to **4.2.6**.\n- /build buildcustomitem -> /build encodehelditem\n- The \"REFRESH / GENERATE TREE\" button was removed from build output, trees are now always read fresh."
		},
